// ==============================================================================
// பாடம் 1: நீரின்றி அமையாது உலகு (உரைநடை உலகம்) [Q001 - Q028]
// மாமழை போற்றுதும், குடபுலவியனார் (புறநானூறு 18), கரிகாலன் கல்லணை, முல்லைப் பெரியாறு அணை (ஜான் பென்னிகுவிக்), நீர்நிலைப் பெயர்கள் (அகழி, ஆழிக்கிணறு, ஏரி, இலஞ்சி, கண்மாய், குளம்)
// ==============================================================================
{"id": "9th-u2-q001", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-neerindri-amaiyaadhu-ulagu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-neer-karutharangu-intro", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நீரின்றி அமையாது உலகு கருத்தரங்கம் குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. கருத்தரங்கத் தலைவராக மாணவர் வெண்மதி பொறுப்பேற்றுத் தலைமை உரை ஆற்றினார்.\n2. 'நீரின்றி அமையாது உலகு' என்னும் திருவள்ளுவரின் வரிகள், நீர் இன்றி உலக இயக்கம் நடைபெறாது என்ற வாழ்வியல் உண்மையை உணர்த்துகிறது.\n3. 'நீரும் நீராடலும் வாழ்வியலோடு பிணைக்கப்பட்டவை' என்று குறிப்பிட்டவர் பேராசிரியர் ச. அகத்தியலிங்கம் ஆவார்.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி", "B": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "1, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "'நீரும் நீராடலும் வாழ்வியலோடு பிணைக்கப்பட்டவை' என்று கூறியவர் பேராசிரியர் தொ. பரமசிவன் ஆவார் (கூற்று 3 தவறு). எனவே 1 மற்றும் 2 சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the statements regarding the water symposium in 'Neerindri Amaiyaadhu Ulagu':\n1. Student Venmathi served as the symposium moderator and delivered the presidential address.\n2. Thiruvalluvar's axiom 'Neerindri Amaiyaadhu Ulagu' declares that no earthly existence can function without water.\n3. Prof. S. Agasthialingam remarked that 'Water and ritual bathing are inextricably intertwined with Tamil cultural life'.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2 only are correct", "B": "2 and 3 only are correct", "C": "1 and 3 only are correct", "D": "All are correct"}, "explanation": "Cultural anthropologist Prof. Tho. Paramasivan (not Agasthialingam) famously stated that water and bathing rituals are rooted in Tamil cultural life. Statements 1 and 2 are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 24, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 24", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["water_symposium", "thiruvalluvar", "paramasivan"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u2-q002", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-neerindri-amaiyaadhu-ulagu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-arthur-cotton-kallanai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சர் ஆர்தர் காட்டன் மற்றும் கல்லணை குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. இந்திய நீர்ப்பாசனத்தின் தந்தை என்று அறியப்படுபவர் சர் ஆர்தர் காட்டன் ஆவார்.\n2. இவர் கல்லணையை பல ஆண்டுகள் ஆராய்ந்து, அதன் கட்டுமான உத்தியை வியந்து 'கிராண்ட் அணைக்கட்' (Grand Anicut) எனப் பெயரிட்டார்.\n3. கல்லணையின் கட்டுமான நுட்பத்தைக் கொண்டே இவர் 1873-இல் கிருஷ்ணா நதியின் குறுக்கே அணையைக் கட்டினார்.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அனைத்தும் சரி", "B": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "1, 3 மட்டும் சரி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 26: 1873-இல் சர் ஆர்தர் காட்டன் கோதாவரி ஆற்றின் குறுக்கே 'தௌலீஸ்வரம் அணையை'க் கட்டினார் (கிருஷ்ணா நதி அல்ல; கூற்று 3 தவறு). எனவே 1 மற்றும் 2 சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the statements regarding Sir Arthur Cotton and the Kallanai:\n1. Sir Arthur Cotton is universally acclaimed as the 'Father of Indian Irrigation'.\n2. Having researched Kallanai for years, he marveled at its hydraulic genius and named it the 'Grand Anicut'.\n3. Applying Kallanai's foundation technology, he built a massive dam across the Krishna River in 1873.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "All are correct", "B": "1 and 2 only are correct", "C": "2 and 3 only are correct", "D": "1 and 3 only are correct"}, "explanation": "In 1873, Sir Arthur Cotton built the Dowleswaram Barrage across the Godavari River, not the Krishna. Statements 1 and 2 are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 26, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 26", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["arthur_cotton", "kallanai", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u2-q003", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-neerindri-amaiyaadhu-ulagu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-kallanai-construction-technique", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கரிகால சோழன் காவிரியின் குறுக்கே கல்லணையைக் கட்டிய விதம் குறித்த சரியான பொறியியல் விளக்கம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இரும்புத் தூண்களை ஆழமாக நட்டு அதன்மேல் பாறைகளை அடுக்கிக் கட்டினார்", "B": "செங்கற்களைக் கொண்டு சுண்ணக்கலவையால் சுவர்களை எழுப்பிக் கட்டினார்", "C": "காவிரி ஆற்று மணலில் பெரிய பாறைகளைப் போட்டு, அவை மணலில் புதையப் புதைய அவற்றின் மேல் மற்றொரு பாறையை வைத்துத் தண்ணீரால் கரையாத களிமண்ணைப் பூசி உறுதியாக்கினார்", "D": "மரப் பலகைகளைக் கொண்டு நீரோட்டத்தைத் தடுத்துப் பாறைகளை அடுக்கினார்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 25: காவிரி ஆற்று மணலில் பெரிய பாறைகளைப் போட்டனர்; அவை மணலில் அமிழும்போது அதன்மேல் மற்றொரு பாறையை வைத்து, நடுவே ஒருவகைக் களிமண்ணைப் பூசி இணைத்துக் கட்டினர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What was the ingenious ancient civil engineering technique employed by Karikala Chola to construct the Kallanai across the flowing Kaveri?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Driving deep cast-iron pylons into the bedrock and laying cut stones", "B": "Erecting brick masonry ramparts bonded with lime mortar", "C": "Placing huge boulders on sandy riverbed, letting them sink under water pressure, stacking consecutive stone layers upon them, and cementing with unyielding water-resistant clay", "D": "Constructing wooden timber cofferdams to divert water flows"}, "explanation": "Karikalan placed massive boulders on shifting river sands, allowing them to anchor into the subsoil, cementing them with water-resistant silt clay."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 25, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 25", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["kallanai", "engineering_miracle", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u2-q004", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-neerindri-amaiyaadhu-ulagu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-pennycuick-mullaperiyar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஜான் பென்னிகுவிக் (John Pennycuick) குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. இவர் ஆங்கிலேயர் ஆட்சிக் காலத்தில் தமிழ்நாட்டின் தென்மாவட்டப் பாசனத்திற்காக முல்லைப் பெரியாறு அணையைக் கட்டியவர்.\n2. அணைக் கட்டுமானத்தின் போது ஆங்கிலேய அரசு நிதி ஒதுக்கீடு செய்ய மறுத்தபோது, தம் சொந்தச் சொத்துகளை விற்று அணையைக் கட்டி முடித்தார்.\n3. இதனால் தேனி, திண்டுக்கல், மதுரை உள்ளிட்ட ஐந்து தென்மாவட்ட மக்கள் இன்றும் தம் குழந்தைகளுக்குப் பென்னிகுவிக் எனப் பெயரிட்டு நன்றியோடு நினைவுகூர்கின்றனர்.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி", "B": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "1, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 27 தெரிந்து தெளிவோம்: ஜான் பென்னிகுவிக் முல்லைப் பெரியாறு அணையைக் கட்டினார்; சொந்தச் சொத்துகளை விற்று முடித்தார்; தென் மாவட்ட மக்கள் குழந்தைகளுக்கு இவரது பெயரைச் சூட்டி மகிழ்கின்றனர். அனைத்தும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the statements regarding Colonel John Pennycuick:\n1. He engineered the Mullaperiyar Dam to irrigate the drought-stricken southern districts of Tamil Nadu.\n2. When the British colonial administration halted funding due to monsoon disasters, he liquidated his personal family estates in England to finance the dam.\n3. Grateful farmers in Theni, Dindigul, and Madurai districts still christen their newborn children after Pennycuick.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2 only are correct", "B": "2 and 3 only are correct", "C": "1 and 3 only are correct", "D": "All 1, 2, and 3 are correct"}, "explanation": "All three statements faithfully state the historical facts about Col. John Pennycuick from page 27."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 27, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 27", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["pennycuick", "mullaperiyar", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u2-q005", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "assertion_reason", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-neerindri-amaiyaadhu-ulagu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-mangudi-maruthanar-quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): 'நீரும் நிலமும் புணரியோர் ஈண்டு உடம்பும் உயிரும் படைத்திசினோரே' என்று மதுரைக்காஞ்சியில் மாங்குடி மருதனார் பாடியுள்ளார்.\nகாரணம் (R): நீர்நிலைகளை உருவாக்கி நிலத்தோடு நீரை இணைத்த மன்னர்களே இவ்வுலகில் உடம்பையும் உயிரையும் காத்தவர்களாகப் போற்றப்படுவர்.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை விளக்குகிறது", "B": "கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு", "C": "கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி", "D": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 25: சங்க இலக்கியத்தில் மாங்குடி மருதனாரும் புறநானூற்றில் குடபுலவியனாரும் நீரும் நிலமும் இணைத்தலின் இன்றியமையாமையைப் பாடியுள்ளனர். கூற்று மற்றும் காரணம் இரண்டும் முற்றிலும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Sangam bard Mangudi Maruthanar sang: 'Those who wed water unto land have brought forth life and body upon this earth'.\nReason (R): Rulers who excavated irrigation reservoirs and united flowing water with arable land were celebrated as sustainers of human mortal life.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are true, and (R) correctly explains (A)", "B": "(A) is true, but (R) is false", "C": "(A) is false, but (R) is true", "D": "Both (A) and (R) are false"}, "explanation": "Both (A) and (R) accurately reflect Sangam ecological wisdom highlighted on page 25."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 25, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 25", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["sangam_ecology", "mangudi_maruthanar", "assertion_reason"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u2-q006", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-neerindri-amaiyaadhu-ulagu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-kumizhi-thoombu-technology", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பண்டையத் தமிழர்கள் ஏரிகளில் பயன்படுத்திய 'குமிழித்தூம்பு' (Kumizhi Thoombu) அமைப்பின் முதன்மைச் செயல்பாடு என்ன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வெள்ளக் காலங்களில் மீன்களைப் பிடிப்பது", "B": "ஏரியின் அடியில் தங்கும் சேற்றை நீரோட்டத்தோடு வெளியேற்றித் தூய நீரை மட்டும் பாசனத்திற்கு வழங்குவது", "C": "ஏரி நீரின் வெப்பநிலையை அளவிடுவது", "D": "ஏரியின் கரையை உயர்த்திக் கட்டுவது"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 26: குமிழித்தூம்பு என்பது ஏரியின் அடியில் உள்ள சேற்றையும் நீரையும் சுழற்றி, சேற்றை அடியோடு வெளியேற்றித் தூய நீரைப் பாசன வாய்க்கால்களுக்கு அனுப்பும் பண்டையத் தமிழரின் உன்னதப் பொறியியல் அமைப்பாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What was the primary technological function of the 'Kumizhi Thoombu' sluice gate engineered in ancient Tamil irrigation tanks?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Trapping fresh water fish during flood runoff", "B": "Flushing out submerged silt from the tank bed while discharging clean surface water into irrigation canals", "C": "Monitoring the temperature of lake waters", "D": "Raising the physical height of tank bunds"}, "explanation": "Kumizhi Thoombu was an ingenious hydro-pneumatic silt-scouring sluice that expelled bottom sludge while feeding clean water to agricultural fields."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 26, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 26", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["kumizhi_thoombu", "traditional_technology", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u2-q007", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-neerindri-amaiyaadhu-ulagu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-world-environment-day", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "உலக சுற்றுச்சூழல் நாள் (World Environment Day) ஒவ்வோர் ஆண்டும் எந்த நாளில் கொண்டாடப்படுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மார்ச் 22", "B": "ஏப்ரல் 22", "C": "ஜூன் 5", "D": "செப்டம்பர் 16"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 27: 'ஜூன் 5 - உலகச் சுற்றுச்சூழல் நாள்'. (மார்ச் 22 உலக நீர் நாள்; ஏப்ரல் 22 புவி நாள்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "On which date is World Environment Day commemorated globally every year as mentioned in the textbook?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "March 22", "B": "April 22", "C": "June 5", "D": "September 16"}, "explanation": "Page 27 explicitly marks June 5 as World Environment Day."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 27, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 27", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["environment_day", "dates", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u2-q008", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-neerindri-amaiyaadhu-ulagu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-neeraadal-marabu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பேராசிரியர் தொ. பரமசிவன் குறிப்பிடும் தமிழரின் 'நீராடல்' மரபு குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. 'குளிர்த்தல்' என்பதே 'குளித்தல்' என மருவியுள்ளது.\n2. உடம்பைத் தூய்மை செய்தல் என்பதையும் கடந்து, உடம்பைச் சூரிய வெப்பத்திலிருந்து குளிர்விப்பதே குளித்தலின் நோக்கமாகும்.\n3. ஆண்டாள் நாச்சியார் 'தீயினால் குடைந்து நீராடி' என்று திருப்பாவையில் பாடியுள்ளார்.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அனைத்தும் சரி", "B": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "1, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி"}, "explanation": "ஆண்டாள் நாச்சியார் 'மழைக்காலத்துத் தீயினால்' அல்ல; 'சிற்றஞ்சிறு காலே வந்து உன்னைச் சேவித்து... குடைந்து நீராடி' எனப் பாடியுள்ளார் (கூற்று 3 தவறு). 1 மற்றும் 2 சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the statements by Prof. Tho. Paramasivan regarding traditional Tamil bathing culture:\n1. The word 'Kulithal' (bathing) is etymologically derived from 'Kulirthal' (cooling down the body).\n2. Beyond superficial bodily hygiene, bathing fundamentally aimed to cool the biological frame from tropical heat.\n3. Andal sang 'Theeyinaal Kudaindhu Neeraadi' in her Tiruppavai.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "All are correct", "B": "2 and 3 only are correct", "C": "1 and 3 only are correct", "D": "1 and 2 only are correct"}, "explanation": "Andal sang 'Kulla Kulira Kudaindhu Neeraadi' in Tiruppavai. Statement 3 is false; 1 and 2 are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 25, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 25", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["paramasivan", "bathing_traditions", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u2-q009", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "quote_completion", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-neerindri-amaiyaadhu-ulagu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-avvaiyar-nalvazhi-quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'வரப்புயர நீர் உயரும்; நீருயர நெல் உயரும்;\nநெல்லுயரக் குடி உயரும்; குடியுயரக் கோல் உயரும்;'\nஇப்புகழ்பெற்ற வரிகளை இயற்றிய புலவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஔவையார்", "B": "காக்கைபாடினியார்", "C": "வெள்ளிவீதியார்", "D": "கபிலர்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 29: 'வரப்புயர நீர் உயரும்... கோலுயரக் கோன் உயர்வான்' என்று பாடியவர் சங்கப் பெண்பாற் புலவர் ஔவையார் ஆவார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'Varappuyara Neer Uyarum; Neeruyara Nel Uyarum; Nelluyara Kudi Uyarum...' — Who composed this celebrated ethical poem on water?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Avvaiyar", "B": "Kakkaipaadiniyar", "C": "Velliveethiyar", "D": "Kapilar"}, "explanation": "Avvaiyar composed these timeless verses illustrating that royal prosperity depends on elevated water bunds."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 29, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 29", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["avvaiyar", "nalvazhi", "quote_completion"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u2-q010", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-neerindri-amaiyaadhu-ulagu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-dowleswaram-year", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சர் ஆர்தர் காட்டன் கோதாவரி ஆற்றின் குறுக்கே 'தௌலீஸ்வரம் அணையை'க் கட்டி முடித்த ஆண்டு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1829", "B": "1873", "C": "1885", "D": "1895"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 26: சர் ஆர்தர் காட்டன் 1829-இல் கல்லணையை ஆராய்ந்தார்; பின்னர் கல்லணையின் பாடம் கொண்டு 1873-இல் கோதாவரி ஆற்றின் குறுக்கே தௌலீஸ்வரம் அணையைக் கட்டி முடித்தார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which year did Sir Arthur Cotton complete the construction of the Dowleswaram Barrage across the Godavari River?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1829", "B": "1873", "C": "1885", "D": "1895"}, "explanation": "Page 26 explicitly dates the completion of the Dowleswaram Barrage across Godavari to the year 1873."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 26, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 26", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["dowleswaram", "arthur_cotton", "dam_history"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u2-q011", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-neerindri-amaiyaadhu-ulagu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-cotton-kallanai-research-year", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆங்கிலேயப் பொறியியலாளர் சர் ஆர்தர் காட்டன் காவிரிப் பாசனப் பகுதிக்குத் தனிப் பொறுப்பாளராக நியமிக்கப்பட்ட ஆண்டு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1816", "B": "1820", "C": "1829", "D": "1856"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 26: 1829-ஆம் ஆண்டு காவிரிப் பாசனப் பகுதிக்குத் தனிப் பொறுப்பாளராக சர் ஆர்தர் காட்டன் நியமிக்கப்பட்டார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which year was Sir Arthur Cotton officially appointed by the British administration as the chief supervisor for Kaveri river delta irrigation?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1816", "B": "1820", "C": "1829", "D": "1856"}, "explanation": "Page 26 records that Cotton was appointed in 1829 to investigate the siltation crisis in the Kaveri delta."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 26, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 26", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["arthur_cotton", "kaveri_delta", "historical_dates"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u2-q012", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-neerindri-amaiyaadhu-ulagu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-kanmai-pandya-nadu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாண்டிய மண்டலத்து நிலப்பகுதியில் வேளாண்மை பாசனத்துக்கான ஏரிகளுக்கு வழங்கும் மரபான பெயர் என்ன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இலஞ்சி", "B": "கேணி", "C": "ஊருணி", "D": "கண்மாய்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 28: பாண்டி மண்டலத்தில் ஏரிக்கு 'கண்மாய்' என்று பெயர் வழங்கப்படுகிறது. கம்மாய் என்பது இதன் வட்டார வழக்கு."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the traditional regional term used across the ancient Pandya territory for large agricultural irrigation lakes?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Ilanji", "B": "Keni", "C": "Ooruni", "D": "Kanmaai (கண்மாய்)"}, "explanation": "Page 28 defines 'Kanmaai' as the classic irrigation reservoir name native to the Pandya realm."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 28, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 28", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["kanmaai", "pandya_mandalam", "waterbody_names"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u2-q013", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-neerindri-amaiyaadhu-ulagu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-neeraadal-ritual-quotes", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ் மரபில் நீராடல் குறித்த பின்வரும் இலக்கியச் சான்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. திருமணமான பின் கூடி நீராடும் வழக்கம் 'கடலாடுதல்' என்றும், திருவிழாக்களில் இறைவனை நீராட்டுவது 'நீராட்டு விழா' என்றும் அழைக்கப்படும்.\n2. சனி நீராடு என்பது ஔவையாரின் வாக்கு.\n3. ஆண்டாள் நாச்சியார் 'குள்ளக் குளிரக் குடைந்து நீராடி' என்று திருப்பாவையில் பாடியுள்ளார்.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அனைத்தும் சரி", "B": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "1, 3 மட்டும் சரி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 25: சனி நீராடு (ஔவையார்), குள்ளக் குளிரக் குடைந்து நீராடி (ஆண்டாள்), தெய்வச்சிலைகளைக் குளிர்க்க வைப்பது திருமஞ்சனம் ஆடுதல். அனைத்துக் கூற்றுகளும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the literary evidences of water bathing rituals documented in the lesson:\n1. Ritual sea bathing is called 'Kadalaadudhal' and sanctifying temple idols in water is called 'Thirumanjanam'.\n2. 'Sani Neeraadu' (bathe in oil on Saturdays) is the ancient proverb by Avvaiyar.\n3. Andal described joyful collective bathing as 'Kulla Kulira Kudaindhu Neeraadi' in Tiruppavai.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "All are correct", "B": "1 and 2 only are correct", "C": "2 and 3 only are correct", "D": "1 and 3 only are correct"}, "explanation": "All three literary attestations are confirmed on textbook page 25."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 25, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 25", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["bathing_culture", "andal", "avvaiyar"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u2-q014", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-neerindri-amaiyaadhu-ulagu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-speaker-ameena", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நீரின்றி அமையாது உலகு கருத்தரங்கில் 'நீரும் மேலாண்மையும்' என்ற தலைப்பில் உரை நிகழ்த்திய மாணவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மாணவர் வெண்மதி", "B": "மாணவர் ஆமீனா", "C": "மாணவர் முகிலன்", "D": "மாணவர் மெர்சி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 25: மாணவர் ஆமீனா 'நீரும் மேலாண்மையும்' என்ற தலைப்பிலும், மாணவர் முகிலன் 'தமிழ் மரபும் நீர் மேலாண்மையும்' என்ற தலைப்பிலும், மாணவர் மெர்சி 'இன்றைய வாழ்வில் தண்ணீர்' என்ற தலைப்பிலும் உரை நிகழ்த்தினர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the lesson's symposium, which student presented the paper on 'Water and Management' (நீரும் மேலாண்மையும்)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Student Venmathi", "B": "Student Ameena", "C": "Student Mugilan", "D": "Student Mercy"}, "explanation": "Student Ameena spoke on 'Water and Management' on page 25."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 25, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 25", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["symposium_speakers", "ameena", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u2-q015", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-neerindri-amaiyaadhu-ulagu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-thirumoolar-body-temple", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ் மரபில் 'உடம்பினை முன்னம் இழுக்கென்று இருந்தேன்; உடம்பினுக் குள்ளே உறுபொருள் கண்டேன்' என்று உடம்பைப் பாதுகாத்தலின் பெருமையைப் பாடிய சித்தர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பட்டினத்தார்", "B": "சிவவாக்கியார்", "C": "திருமூலர்", "D": "அகத்தியர்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 25: திருமூலர் திருமந்திரத்தில் உடம்பைப் போற்றுவதன் சிறப்பைப் பாடியுள்ளார்; இதனை ஒட்டியே உடம்பைக் குளிர்க்க வைக்கும் நீராடல் மரபு உருவானது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which revered Tamil Siddha composed the verses 'Udambinai Munnam Izhukkendru Irundhen; Udambinuk Kulle Uruporul Kanden' highlighting bodily sanctification?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Pattinathar", "B": "Sivavakkiyar", "C": "Thirumoolar", "D": "Agathiyar"}, "explanation": "Thirumoolar in his Thirumandhiram declared the physical body as the temple of the divine soul."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 25, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 25", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["thirumoolar", "thirumandhiram", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u2-q016", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-neerindri-amaiyaadhu-ulagu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-kaveri-delta-silt-crisis", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "காவிரி வடிநிலப் பகுதியில் ஏற்பட்ட பாசன நெருக்கடி குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. காவிரி ஆற்றில் தொடர்ந்து வண்டல் படிந்து மேடாகி, கொள்ளிடத்தில் நீர் அதிகமாகப் பாய்ந்து காவிரி வறண்டது.\n2. இதனால் பயிர்கள் கருகி, தஞ்சை வட்டாரத்தில் பெரும் பஞ்சம் ஏற்படும் நிலை உருவானது.\n3. இப்பிரச்சினைக்குத் தீர்வாகவே 1829-இல் சர் ஆர்தர் காட்டன் கல்லணையை ஆராய்ந்து கொள்ளிடத்தின் குறுக்கே புதிய அணைகளைக் கட்டினார்.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2 மட்டும்", "B": "2, 3 மட்டும்", "C": "1, 3 மட்டும்", "D": "அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 26: காவிரி மணல் மேடாகி நீர் கொள்ளிடத்தில் வீணானபோது காட்டன் கல்லணையை ஆய்வு செய்து சீரமைத்தார். மூன்று கூற்றுகளும் முற்றிலும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the statements regarding the Kaveri delta hydrological crisis in the early 19th century:\n1. Continuous siltation raised the Kaveri bed, causing surplus water to drain uselessly into the Kollidam while Kaveri channels dried up.\n2. The resulting severe drought devastated the Thanjavur granary, threatening acute famine.\n3. To resolve this existential crisis, Sir Arthur Cotton was deputed in 1829 to study Kallanai and remodel the delta headworks.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2 only", "B": "2 and 3 only", "C": "1 and 3 only", "D": "All 1, 2, and 3 are correct"}, "explanation": "All three statements faithfully state the historical environmental context behind Cotton's research."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 26, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 26", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["arthur_cotton", "kallanai_crisis", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u2-q017", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "assertion_reason", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-neerindri-amaiyaadhu-ulagu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-grand-anicut-world-fame", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): கல்லணை உலகிலேயே இன்றும் பயன்பாட்டில் உள்ள மிகப் பழமையான அணைகளுள் ஒன்றாகத் திகழ்கிறது.\nகாரணம் (R): இரண்டாயிரத்திற்கும் மேற்பட்ட ஆண்டுகளுக்கு முன்பே பாயும் ஆற்றின் மணல் அடித்தளத்தில் நிலையான அணையைக் கட்டிய தமிழரின் பொறியியல் உத்தி உலகையே வியப்பில் ஆழ்த்துகிறது.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை விளக்குகிறது", "B": "கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு", "C": "கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி", "D": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு"}, "explanation": "கல்லணை 2000 ஆண்டுகள் கடந்தும் பயன்பாட்டில் உள்ள உலகப் பொறியியல் அற்புதம். மணல் அடித்தளத் தொழில்நுட்பமே இதற்குக் காரணம். கூற்று மற்றும் காரணம் இரண்டும் முற்றிலும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Kallanai stands today as one of the oldest operating water-diversion dams in the entire world.\nReason (R): The ancient Tamil civil engineering feat of erecting an unyielding stone barrage over shifting river sand 2,000 years ago astounds modern hydraulic scientists.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are true, and (R) correctly explains (A)", "B": "(A) is true, but (R) is false", "C": "(A) is false, but (R) is true", "D": "Both (A) and (R) are false"}, "explanation": "Both statements accurately describe the world-heritage status of Karikala Chola's Grand Anicut."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 26, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 26", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["kallanai", "world_wonder", "assertion_reason"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u2-q018", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-neerindri-amaiyaadhu-ulagu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-karikalan-builder", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "காவிரி ஆற்றின் குறுக்கே உலகப் புகழ்பெற்ற கல்லணையைக் கட்டிய சோழப் பேரரசன் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "முதலாம் ராஜராஜ சோழன்", "B": "கரிகால சோழன்", "C": "முதலாம் குலோத்துங்கன்", "D": "சுந்தர சோழன்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 25: காவிரி ஆற்றின் குறுக்கே கல்லணையைக் கட்டிய பெருமை கரிகால வளவனுக்கு (கரிகால சோழன்) உரியதாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which illustrious Sangam Chola monarch engineered the world-renowned Kallanai across the Kaveri River?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Rajaraja Chola I", "B": "Karikala Chola (கரிகால சோழன்)", "C": "Kulothunga I", "D": "Sundara Chola"}, "explanation": "Karikala Chola is the historic builder of Kallanai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 25, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 25", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"