{"id": "9th-u2-q049", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-neerindri-amaiyaadhu-ulagu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-nalvazhi-full-progression", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஔவையாரின் நல்வழிப் பாடலில் கூறப்படும் சங்கிலித் தொடர் முன்னேற்ற வரிசையை ஆராய்க:\nவரப்புயர → நீர் உயரும் → நெல் உயரும் → குடி உயரும் → கோல் உயரும் → கோன் உயர்வான்.\n1. நாட்டின் மன்னன் உயர்வதற்கு அடிப்படையானது வயலின் வரப்பு உயரக் கட்டுதலே ஆகும்.\n2. வரப்பு உயர்ந்தால் நீர் தேங்கும்; நீர் தேங்கினால் நெல் விளையும்; நெல் விளைந்தால் குடிமக்கள் வாழ்வு உயரும்.\n3. ஔவையார் இந்நூலில் மன்னனின் வீரமே நாட்டின் முதன்மை பலம் எனக் குறிப்பிடுகிறார்.\nமேற்கண்ட கூற்றுகளுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2 மட்டும் சரி", "B": "2, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "1, 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "ஔவையார் மன்னனின் வீரத்தை விடவும் 'உழவும் நீர் மேலாண்மையுமே' அரசனின் மாட்சிக்கு அடிப்படை என்கிறார் (கூற்று 3 தவறு). 1 மற்றும் 2 சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the chain-causation sequence articulated in Avvaiyar's Nalvazhi:\nVarappuyara → Neer Uyarum → Nel Uyarum → Kudi Uyarum → Kol Uyarum → Kon Uyarvaan.\n1. The prosperity of the monarch rests fundamentally upon raising elevated field bunds to conserve water.\n2. Retaining water yields bumper paddy crops, which directly enriches citizens and empowers state governance.\n3. Avvaiyar claims that military conquests alone determine the sovereign's greatness.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2 only are correct", "B": "2 and 3 only are correct", "C": "1 and 3 only are correct", "D": "All are correct"}, "explanation": "Avvaiyar anchors state prosperity in agrarian water management, not militarism. Statements 1 and 2 are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 29, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 29", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["avvaiyar", "nalvazhi", "statement_analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u2-q050", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-neerindri-amaiyaadhu-ulagu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-kumizhi-sluice-concept", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஏரியின் கீழ்மட்டத்தில் சேற்றை நீக்கப் பயன்படும் 'குமிழித்தூம்பில்' உள்ள இரு துளைகள் எதனை வெளியேற்றுகின்றன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "காற்று மற்றும் ஒலியை வெளியேற்றுகின்றன", "B": "அடித்துவாரத்தின் வழியே சேறும், மேல்துவாரத்தின் வழியே நீரும் வெளியேறுகின்றன", "C": "மீன்களையும் பாசிகளையும் வெளியேற்றுகின்றன", "D": "நீரை மட்டுமே வெளியேற்றுகின்றன"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 26: குமிழித்தூம்பில் கீழ் துளையின் வழியே சேறும், மேல் துளையின் வழியே நீரும் வெளியேறிப் பாசனக் கால்வாயில் கலக்கும் தொழில்நுட்பம் அமைக்கப்பட்டிருந்தது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the ancient Tamil 'Kumizhi Thoombu' sluice, what discharge function is served by its dual-orifice design?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Releasing compressed air and sound resonance", "B": "The bottom orifice scours out dense silt while the upper orifice discharges clean irrigation water", "C": "Flushing out river fish and weed debris", "D": "Discharging purely surface water without touching sediment"}, "explanation": "Kumizhi Thoombu's dual vents dynamically scour bottom silt while releasing irrigation water."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 26, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 26", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["kumizhi_thoombu", "sluice_engineering", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u2-q051", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-neerindri-amaiyaadhu-ulagu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-symposium-moderator", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நீரின்றி அமையாது உலகு கருத்தரங்கில் தலைமையுரை ஆற்றிய மாணவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மாணவர் ஆமீனா", "B": "மாணவர் முகிலன்", "C": "மாணவர் வெண்மதி", "D": "மாணவர் மெர்சி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 24: 'தலைமையுரை - மாணவர் வெண்மதி' என்று தெளிவாகக் குறிப்பிடப்பட்டுள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who delivered the presidential keynote address presiding over the symposium on water?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Student Ameena", "B": "Student Mugilan", "C": "Student Venmathi (மாணவர் வெண்மதி)", "D": "Student Mercy"}, "explanation": "Student Venmathi presided over the symposium on page 24."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 24, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 24", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": nu