{"id": "9th-u2-q087", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-03-purananuru-thanneer", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-purananuru-thanneer", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "குடபுலவியனார் பாடிய இப்புறநானூற்றுப் பாடலுக்குரிய (பா.எண். 18) திணை மற்றும் துறை முறையே எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பாடாண்திணை, செவியறிவுறூஉ", "B": "வஞ்சித்திணை, குடைநிலை", "C": "பொதுவியல் திணை, முதுமொழிக்காஞ்சித் துறை", "D": "வாகைத்திணை, அரசவாகை"}, "explanation": "பாடலின் திணை: பொதுவியல் (புறத்திணைகளுக்கெல்லாம் பொதுவான செய்தி); துறை: முதுமொழிக்காஞ்சி (அறம், பொருள், இன்பம் என்னும் மூன்றின் உறுதியை உரைத்தல்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What are the Thinai (poetic landscape) and Thurai (theme) of this Purananuru poem (verse 18)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Paadaan thinai, Seviyarivuruu", "B": "Vanji thinai, Kudainilai", "C": "Pothuviyal thinai, Mudhumozhikkanchi thurai", "D": "Vaagai thinai, Arasavaagai"}, "explanation": "Thinai is Pothuviyal (universal truths common to exterior poetry), and Thurai is Mudhumozhikkanchi (counseling virtues on Dharma, Artha, and Kama)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educati