{"id": "9th-u2-q116", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-pagupadha-uruppilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-pagupadha-uruppilakkanam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சொல்லின் முதலில் நின்று முதனிலை எனவும், பகாப்பதமாகவும், வினைச்சொல்லில் ஏவலாகவும் அமையும் பகுபத உறுப்பு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "விகுதி", "B": "இடைநிலை", "C": "சாரியை", "D": "பகுதி"}, "explanation": "பகுதி சொல்லின் முதலில் நிற்கும்; இதனை முதனிலை என்றும் அழைப்பர். இது பகாப்பதமாக அமையும்; வினைச்சொற்களில் ஏவலாக (கட்டளையாக) அமையும் (எ.கா. நட, படி, செய்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which morpheme stands at the beginning as an imperative base and functions as an indivisible root?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Viguthi", "B": "Idainilai", "C": "Saariyai", "D": "Paguthi (Root base)"}, "explanation": "Paguthi (base/root) stands initially, functions as an atomic root (Pagaappadham), and appears as an imperative command in verbs."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 39, "chapter": null, "section": null, "referenc