{"id": "9th-u2-q120", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-pagupadha-uruppilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-pagupadha-uruppilakkanam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பகுதியையும் பிற உறுப்புகளையும் இணைக்கும் பொருட்டு, பெரும்பாலும் பகுதிக்கும் இடைநிலைக்கும் இடையில் வரும் உறுப்பு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "விகுதி", "B": "சாரியை", "C": "விகாரம்", "D": "சந்தி"}, "explanation": "பகுதியையும் பிற உறுப்புகளையும் இணைக்கும் உறுப்பு 'சந்தி' எனப்படும். இது பெரும்பாலும் பகுதிக்கும் இடைநிலைக்கும் இடையில் வரும் (எ.கா. படித்தான் = படி + த் + த் + ஆன்; இதில் முதல் 'த்' சந்தி)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which morpheme connects the base with other elements, usually positioned between root and tense medial?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Viguthi", "B": "Saariyai", "C": "Vigaaram", "D": "Sandhi (Euphonic connective)"}, "explanation": "Sandhi is a euphonic transition consonant inserted chiefly between the root (Paguthi) and the medial (Idainilai)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 4