{"id": "9th-u2-q123", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-pagupadha-uruppilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-pagupadha-uruppilakkanam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பகுபத உறுப்புகளுள் அடங்காமல் பகுதி, விகுதிக்கு நடுவில் காலத்தை உணர்த்தாமல் வரும் மெய்யெழுத்து எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உடம்படுமெய்", "B": "விகாரம்", "C": "எழுத்துப் பேறு", "D": "பெயர் இடைநிலை"}, "explanation": "பகுபத உறுப்புகளுள் அடங்காமல் பகுதிக்கும் விகுதிக்கும் நடுவில் காலத்தை உணர்த்தாமல் வரும் மெய்யெழுத்து 'எழுத்துப் பேறு' ஆகும். சாரியை வரும் இடத்தில் 'த்' வந்தால் அது எழுத்துப் பேறு எனப்படும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is a consonant termed when it appears between root and suffix without conveying tense and outside standard six constituents?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Udambadumei", "B": "Vigaaram", "C": "Ezhutthuppaeru (Auxiliary consonant insert)", "D": "Noun medial"}, "explanation": "Ezhutthuppaeru is an extra consonant (typically 'th') occupying the slot of a saariyai without functioning as a tense marker."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class"