{"id": "9th-u2-q137", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-pagupadha-uruppilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-pagupadha-uruppilakkanam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ் இலக்கணத்தில் எழுத்துப் பேறாகப் பெரும்பாலும் எந்த ஒரு மெய்யெழுத்து மட்டுமே வரும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "'த்' மட்டுமே", "B": "'க்' மட்டுமே", "C": "'ப்' மட்டுமே", "D": "'ச்' மட்டுமே"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் விதி: 'பெரும்பாலும் 'த்' மட்டுமே எழுத்துப் பேறாக வரும். சாரியை இடத்தில் 'த்' வந்தால் அது எழுத்துப் பேறு எனப்படும்.'"}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Tamil grammar, which consonant almost exclusively functions as an Ezhutthuppaeru?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Only 'th'", "B": "Only 'k'", "C": "Only 'p'", "D": "Only 'ch'"}, "explanation": "As stipulated in the textbook, the dental plosive 'th' is almost exclusively the consonant inserted as Ezhutthuppaeru."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 42, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 42", "url": null, "source_no