{"id": "9th-u2-q140", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-pagupadha-uruppilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-pagupadha-uruppilakkanam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'படித்த' (படி + த் + த் + அ) என்னும் பெயரெச்சச் சொல்லில் முதலாவதாக வரும் 'த்' மற்றும் இரண்டாவதாக வரும் 'த்' முறையே எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இறந்தகால இடைநிலை, சந்தி", "B": "சாரியை, எழுத்துப் பேறு", "C": "எழுத்துப் பேறு, சந்தி", "D": "சந்தி, இறந்தகால இடைநிலை"}, "explanation": "படி + த் + த் + அ: பகுதிக்கும் இடைநிலைக்கும் நடுவில் வந்த முதல் 'த்' சந்தி; காலத்தைக் காட்டும் இரண்டாம் 'த்' இறந்தகால இடைநிலை; 'அ' பெயரெச்ச விகுதி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the relative participle 'Padittha' (padi + th + th + a), what do the first 'th' and second 'th' represent respectively?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Past tense medial, Sandhi", "B": "Saariyai, Ezhutthuppaeru", "C": "Ezhutthuppaeru, Sandhi", "D": "Sandhi (euphonic link), Past tense medial"}, "explanation": "The first 'th' connects root to tense marker (Sandhi), and the second 'th' marks past tense (Irandhakaala Idainilai)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbo